# Installations (#82). Requires a JWT with role Admin/Operator/Sales/Designer (planning)
# or Technician (state changes). Port matches launchSettings.json (http profile).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@installationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create installation (state Planned)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/installations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "0199f0a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000001",
  "contractId": "0199f0a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000002",
  "supplyPointId": "0199f0a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000003",
  "name": "FVE Rodinný dom Nitra",
  "plannedPowerKwp": 9.6
}

### List installations filtered by state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/installations?state=Planned
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My installations (technician)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/installations?assignedToMe=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail with state history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update details
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "FVE Rodinný dom Nitra", "plannedPowerKwp": 10.2, "note": "Plechová strecha" }

### Schedule mounting
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scheduledStart": "2026-11-04", "scheduledEnd": "2026-11-05" }

### Assign technicians (user ids with role Technician)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/technicians
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "technicianIds": ["0199f0a0-0000-7000-8000-0000000000aa"] }

### Change state (allowed targets are in allowedTransitions; otherwise 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/transitions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "targetState": "ComponentsOrdered", "note": "Objednané u dodávateľa" }
